        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Latrobe Brewing Company, InBev, Interbrew, AmBev\n- Places: Latrobe, Pennsylvania, Belgium, Brazil, Finland\n- Products: Rolling Rock beer\n\nFacts:\n- Latrobe Brewing Company was founded in 1839 in Latrobe, Pennsylvania.\n- Latrobe Brewing Company was one of the largest breweries in the United States.\n- Latrobe Brewing Company made Rolling Rock beer.\n- In 2004, Latrobe Brewing Company merged into InBev.\n- InBev resulted from the merger of Belgium-based Interbrew and Brazilian brewer AmBev.\n- InBev now exports exclusively to Finland.",
